= Ruth Fischer

Fischer is the leader of the Berlin organization and of the party's left. Born in Vienna, she wants an offensive against the government and the SPD leaders now, and she has a mass following among Berlin's members.

- @berlin
- @offensive
- @root: Return to main

@berlin
title: Mobilize Berlin
subtitle: Mobilize the Berlin organization behind the Left. · dev: kf_left_strength +6, kf_right_dissent +4
unavailable-subtitle: [? if fischer_timer > 0 : [+ fischer_timer +] months before this adviser can act again. ?]
choose-if: fischer_timer = 0
on-arrival: fischer_timer = 3; kf_left_strength += 6; kf_right_dissent += 4

Fischer's Berlin organization turns out in thousands. The Left shows its strength, and the leadership is reminded that it does not control the capital's party.

@offensive
title: Push the offensive
subtitle: Argue that the crisis is the hour of the revolution. · dev: workers_spd −1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if fischer_timer > 0 : [+ fischer_timer +] months before this adviser can act again. ?]
